@startuml
participant Spm
participant RTE
participant LdCom
participant SecOC
participant PduR
participant SoAd
participant TcpIp

Spm -> Spm: Recover metadata
activate Spm
Spm -> RTE: Rte_Write_*(...)
note top
**GM expectation**:

    Metadata are passed to this API.
    The attachment of metadata to PDU
    is in scope to the RTE
end note
activate RTE
RTE -> LdCom: LdCom_Transmit()
activate LdCom 
LdCom -> PduR: PduR_LdComTransmit()
activate PduR
PduR -> SecOC: SecOC_Transmit()
activate SecOC
SecOC -> PduR: PduR_SecOCTransmit()
activate PduR

PduR -> SoAd: SoAd_IfTransmit()
activate SoAd

SoAd -> SoAd: SoAd_GetRemoteAddress()

SoAd -> TcpIp: TcpIp_UdpTransmit()

TcpIp --> SoAd

SoAd -> SoAd: SoAd_ReleaseRemoteAddress()

SoAd --> PduR
deactivate SoAd

PduR --> SecOC
deactivate PduR

SecOC --> PduR
deactivate SecOC

PduR --> LdCom
deactivate PduR

LdCom --> RTE
deactivate LdCom

RTE --> Spm
deactivate RTE
deactivate Spm

@enduml